  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0 - Add dm-verity hashtree build/verify (AvbHashtree) and Reed-Solomon FEC (AvbFec) matching AOSP libfec/avbtool; new CLI commands make_hashtree_image, verify_hashtree, calc_footer_size, fec encode, fec calc-size; fix hashtree descriptor on-disk layout; unconditional signature verification with modulus-size check; CRC32 delegated to Crc32.NET; Native AOT and trimming compatible.",
